ies are determined with the 60 and 50 beads for the 6th and 5h places of the previous season respectively.","7~10순위 : 전 시즌 성적 4위 40개, 3위 30개, 2위 20개, 1위 10개 구슬을 추첨기에 넣어 지명 권 순위 결정":"Priorities 7 to 10: The 4th, 3rd, 2nd, and 1st places of the previous season put 40, 30, 20, and 10 beads in the drawing apparatus to determine the designation right priorities.","연봉 : 월 $10,000(7개월)":"Annual Salary: $10,000 per month (7 months)","연봉 : $70,000(n개월)":"Annual Salary: $70,000 ({{n}} months)","재계약시 : 월 $11,000":"In Case of Contract Renewal: $11,000 per month","2시즌 이상 재계약시 : 월 $12,000":"In case of Contract Renewal for No Less than 2 Seasons: $12,000 per month","신인 드래프트 참가자 나이 제한 규정":"Regulation on restricting a new draft participant's age","대학 3학년 재학생 드래프트 참가 허용":"Allowing participation of a university junior in draft","97시즌 정규리그 성적 역순":"The reverse order of the results of the regular league of the 1997 season","신생팀 LG, 진로(SK)는 각각 5,6순위":"The new teams such as LG and Jinro (SK) are the 5th and the 6th respectively.","외국 선수 교체는 4주 이상 부상일 때 한 팀당 1회 가능":"Each team can substitute an overseas player once when the player has been injured for no less than 4 weeks.","성과급 $10,000이내 추가 지급 가능":"Possible to make a payment more within the incentive of $10,000",미시행:"Unenforced","트라이아웃 및 드래프트로 외국 선수 선발":"Selecting overseas players through tryout and draft","7가지 색상 20개씩 총 140개 구슬과 추첨기를 통해 지명권 순서결정":"Determining the designation right order with the total 140 beads comprising 20 units for each color of 7 colors","2라운드는 1라운드 지명 역순":"The order of the round 2 is the reverse order of the designation of the round 1.","뒤늦게 합류한 나산은 7개 구단 선수 선발 이후 외국 선수 선발":"Nasan joining the league late selects overseas players after the 7 clubs select players."},Operation$1={운영방식:"Operation type",주요규칙:"Major rules","삼심제(Crew of three officials)적용":"Applying the crew of three officials","주심(Referee), 제1부심(1st Umpire), 제2부심(2nd Umpire)":"Referee, 1st Umpire, and 2nd Umpire","한 경기는 10분씩 4쿼터로 진행":"A game is played for 4